 docs/interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst | 22 +--------
 hw/virtio/virtio-balloon.c            | 84 ++++++++++++--------------------
 qapi/machine.json                     | 92 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 75 deletions(-)

